  "description": "Flowers Premium Digital Papers :\nRomantic Toile Digital Paper Pack, Vintage Floral Toile, Gingham & Stripe Seamless Patterns, Wedding, Scrapbooking & Printable Crafts\nYou will receive a total of 10 Flower digital paper backgrounds that can be used for any creative project. The papers are perfect for birthdays, crafts, scrapbooking, invitations, or any project that you want!\n1 Zipped file with:\n• 10 JPG file format – Ideal for printing\n• High-quality SEAMLESS Digital Paper Patterns\n• High Resolution, at 300 dpi\n• Each file is 12 x 12 inches 3600 x 3600 pixels\nWhat does it mean?\nA seamless pattern, also known as a repeating pattern, is a design that can be replicated infinitely without any discernible breaks or interruptions, as illustrated in the sample image.\nCreated by artificial intelligence\nStay updated, and hit follow for more.\nHope you like it, Thanks!",
